sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant S as Staff (tablet, PIN)
  participant C as On-device store (SQLite)
  participant Q as Upload queue
  participant G as Microsoft Graph
  participant L as SharePoint lists
  participant F as Flow F04
  Note over C: Morning: app caches today's runs, checkpoints,<br/>thresholds, staff (PIN hashes), reason codes
  S->>C: Record 9°C on walk-in (ClientId = UUID)
  C-->>S: Instant red "fail" from cached thresholds + corrective action prompt
  C->>Q: Queue response + photo
  Note over S,Q: No Wi-Fi in the cellar, app keeps working
  Q->>G: Back online: $batch create items (up to 20 per call)
  G->>L: Responses written (ClientId unique, so retries never duplicate)
  alt 429 throttled
    G-->>Q: Retry-After → wait and retry
  end
  Q->>G: Upload compressed photo to Photos library
  S->>C: Complete checklist
  Q->>G: Run Status = Completed
  L-->>F: Trigger on run completed
  F->>L: Confirm pass/fail, create corrective actions / work order
  G-->>C: Next refresh pulls official results
